---
description: VaultMesh product and secret boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` for scope, security, and when to open a Work.

- Local-first password manager. Do not add accounts, servers, cross-network sync, sharing, or recovery backdoors.
- `crates/vault-core` owns crypto, format, models, unlock sessions, and rollback.
- Do not commit or log vaults, master passwords, vault keys, protected fields, OTP, private keys, or fill values.
